      "value": "Good feedback, I have been waiting for Malay and Indonesian since a long time ago. I am confused that why they don't just drag the language list from the ISO-639-1 list or something.\n\nBTW, since I see Cantonese in the list, I wonder is it possible to add a dialect which doesn't have a ISO-639-1 code?\n\nIf it's possible to do that. I hope they can also add \"Teochew\", locally as \"潮州话\" or \"潮汕话\", a Chinese dialect with 13.7 million native speakers in China, also many heritage speakers in South East Asia and more than 100 VRChat players.",
