  "details": "I think all the following languages have their representation in the game and should be included on the website and also in the game.\n\nLanguages are big parts of VRChat, so I consider the ability to list your own is very important.\n\nThis game is one of the best places to learn and practice a language at, this could make that even better.\n\nAlso, there maybe increase the number of language slots to 4 ?\n\n- Slovakian (SVK)\n\n- Slovenian (SLO)\n\n- Lithuanian (LIT)\n\n- Latvian (LAV)\n\n- Estonian (EST)\n\n- Ukrainian (UKR)\n\n- Icelandic (ISL)\n\n- Romanian (RON)\n\n- Bulgarian (BUL)\n\n- Luxembourgish (LTZ)\n\n- Greek (ELL)\n\n- Cantonese \n\n- Indonesian (IND)\n\n- Filipino (FIL)\n\n- Thai (TAI)\n\n- Malay (MAL)\n\n- Afrikaans (AFR)",
